WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
Drop. Get down on your hands and knees right away so the shaking cannot knock you over.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.950
Cover. Get under a sturdy table or desk. If there is none, cover your head and neck with your arms.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.950
Hold On. Hold the table leg and stay put until the shaking stops. Do not run outside while it shakes.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.950
Then Move. When it stops, walk calmly to an open area, away from buildings, posts and glass.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.950
Stay Informed. Expect aftershocks. Check PHIVOLCS advisories and call 911 for emergencies.

